Telepathic sight is a passive psionic ability that permanently enhances
the psionicist's perception of living beings around them. Once developed,
this power requires no conscious activation - the mind simply perceives
the presence of life as naturally as the eyes perceive light.

This heightened awareness manifests as a constant sense of nearby living
creatures, functioning identically to the magical sense life effect.
The psionicist becomes aware of the presence of living beings in their
vicinity, even those hidden from normal sight.

Unlike spells that must be cast and maintained, telepathic sight is
woven into the very nature of the trained psionicist's mind. It costs
no mana, has no duration, and cannot be dispelled. It is simply part
of how the gifted mind perceives the world.

This ability develops relatively early in a psionicist's training and
serves as an excellent foundation for other perceptive powers. However,
it cannot be improved through practice - one either perceives life force
or does not.

